    "/rpc": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "JSON-RPC"
        ],
        "summary": "JSON-RPC 2.0 (AUREN aur_* and Ethereum eth_* methods)",
        "description": "Send {\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1,\"method\":\"aur_status\",\"params\":[]}. Batches (up to 50) are supported.\n\nAUREN methods:\n- `aur_status`(): Network status: chain ID, height, fees, supply, peers\n- `aur_getParams`(): Protocol parameters\n- `aur_getBlock`(height | \"latest\"): A block by height or \"latest\"\n- `aur_getTx`(hash): A transaction and its receipt by hash\n- `aur_getAccount`(address): Balance, spendable amount, nonce, pendingNonce, stake and unbonding\n- `aur_getAccountTxs`(address, limit?): Recent transactions of an address\n- `aur_getValidators`(): Validators, voting power, commission\n- `aur_getProposals`(): Governance proposals\n- `aur_getTlds`(): All name endings (TLDs) and their rules\n- `aur_getTld`(tld): One name ending\n- `aur_getNodes`(address?): Node-reward pool, epoch, challenge and registered nodes\n- `aur_resolve`(name): Name to address with a Merkle proof\n- `aur_resolveDomain`(name): Name record without proof\n- `aur_reverse`(address): Address to its primary name (verified both ways)\n- `aur_feeQuote`(): Fee for every transaction type at the current base fee\n- `aur_simulate`(signed tx): Dry-run a signed transaction; returns effects and fee\n- `aur_sendTx`(signed tx): Submit a signed transaction\n- `aur_getGenesis`(): The genesis file\n- `aur_getPeers`(): Connected peers\n\nEthereum methods: eth_chainId, eth_blockNumber, eth_getBalance, eth_getTransactionCount, eth_call, eth_estimateGas, eth_gasPrice, eth_feeHistory, eth_sendRawTransaction, eth_getTransactionReceipt, eth_getTransactionByHash, eth_getBlockByNumber, eth_getBlockByHash, eth_getCode, eth_getStorageAt, eth_getLogs and more.",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "jsonrpc",
                  "method"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "jsonrpc": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "2.0"
                  },
                  "id": {
                    "example": 1
                  },
                  "method": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "aur_status",
                      "aur_getParams",
                      "aur_getBlock",
                      "aur_getTx",
                      "aur_getAccount",
                      "aur_getAccountTxs",
                      "aur_getValidators",
                      "aur_getProposals",
                      "aur_getTlds",
                      "aur_getTld",
                      "aur_getNodes",
                      "aur_resolve",
                      "aur_resolveDomain",
                      "aur_reverse",
                      "aur_feeQuote",
                      "aur_simulate",
                      "aur_sendTx",
                      "aur_getGenesis",
                      "aur_getPeers",
                      "eth_chainId",
                      "eth_getBalance",
                      "eth_sendRawTransaction"
                    ]
                  },
                  "params": {
                    "type": "array"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "JSON-RPC result or error"
          }
        }
      }
    }
